&lt;section&gt;
&lt;devsite-expandable id="gemini-2.0-flash"&gt;
  &lt;h3 class="showalways" id="gemini-2.0-flash"&gt;&lt;b&gt;(Experimental)&lt;/b&gt; Gemini 2.0 Flash&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;aside class="special"&gt;
    &lt;b&gt;Important:&lt;/b&gt; Gemini 2.0 Flash is available as an experimental preview,
    and some supported features are not currently available. If you need a model
    for production-level code, use one of our 1.5 models instead.
  &lt;/aside&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;
    Gemini 2.0 Flash delivers next-gen features and improved capabilities,
    including superior speed, native tool use, multimodal generation, and a 1M token
    context window.
  &lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;
    Learn more about Gemini 2.0 Flash in our &lt;a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models/gemini-v2"&gt;overview page&lt;/a&gt;.
  &lt;/p&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://aistudio.google.com?model=gemini-2.0-flash-exp" class="gemini-api-model-button"&gt;Try in AI Studio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;

